Stock Pilot integrates independent open-source projects as dependencies/services:
TradingAgents — Tauric Research — Apache-2.0 (pinned in pyproject.toml).
OpenAlgo — marketcalls — separately installed service; no source bundled.
QuantStats — Ran Aroussi — optional analytics dependency; no source bundled.
Consult each upstream repository for its current license and service/data requirements.
